# AI Mode Pattern Analysis: Current State & Opportunities

## Executive Summary

The agent system has sophisticated reasoning infrastructure but **missing key AI Mode patterns**. It has pieces (query fan-out, graph storage, reranking) but they're not orchestrated together. The biggest gaps: (1) **no hierarchical chunking with heading context**, (2) **query fan-out not doing semantic variants**, (3) **reranking is dense+sparse fusion, not passage-level LLM evaluation**, (4) **synthesis lacks reasoning transparency/attribution**.

